VALUES ('1e57fa2f-fb8c-4100-a89f-a67d1f3a8823', 'NC26.1.SGMR.1', 2, 'numeric', 'Building 3D shapes', 'Dev builds a lighthouse from a cylinder and a cone. The flat face of the cone sits on one flat face of the cylinder, with no gap. How many flat faces of the two shapes are not touching the other shape?', '[]', '1', NULL, 'The cone has 1 flat face, and it touches the cylinder. The cylinder has 2 flat faces, and 1 of them touches the cone. Only the cylinder''s other flat face is not touching the other shape, so the answer is 1.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"1","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Cylinder has 2 flat faces, cone has 1. The cone''s flat face touches one cylinder face; those two touch. Remaining: the cylinder''s other flat face = 1.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-23T00:30:06.000Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
