VALUES ('14b60d39-a1b6-45c8-bd67-2e5f6d24d894', 'NC26.1.SGMR.3', 2, 'numeric', 'Compare two lengths with a third object', 'Kim has 3 straws. The red straw is as long as the blue straw. The green straw is shorter than the red straw. How many straws are longer than the green straw?', '[]', '2', NULL, 'Red and blue are the same length. Green is shorter than red, so green is shorter than blue too. Two straws, the red one and the blue one, are longer than the green straw.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"2","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Red = blue, green < red, so green < blue too. Red and blue are longer than green: 2.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-22T19:21:45.494Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
